<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Australian Men's Hardcourt tennis championship at Memorial Drive on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding).</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-2 6-1.</p>
</text>
